   "text": [
    "",
    "Long ago a ",
    {
     "text": "Fracture",
     "color": "#b57bff"
    },
    " tore the sky of Quanta. Look up: those rifts are still open. Pokémon from every region come through them... and sometimes, legendaries. We need trainers to help us understand it."
